 "cms": {
  "FAQ": [
   {
    "__id": "faq0",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "What is Overpaid?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Product basics",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Overpaid is a team of AI agents that recovers money you’re owed: forgotten subscriptions, missed refunds, price drops and duplicate charges. It finds them in your receipts and statements, then claims every dollar back on the merchants’ own sites, with your approval.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq1",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "How does Overpaid find money?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Product basics",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>You drop in receipts and statements. Overpaid reads them, matches each purchase against merchant policies, and shows one number: the money on the table, with a reason for every line.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq2",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "What can Overpaid fix for me?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Product basics",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>It cancels subscriptions you no longer use, requests refunds for duplicate charges, claims price adjustments, and opens claims for orders that never arrived.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq3",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Who is Overpaid for?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Product basics",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Anyone with more subscriptions, receipts and cards than time. It is built for busy people who would rather not spend evenings on hold with support.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq4",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "How is Overpaid different from a budgeting app?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Product basics",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Budgeting apps show you charts. Overpaid goes to the merchants' own websites and gets the money back, while you watch and approve.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq5",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "How do the agents work?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Forecasting & insights",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Each fix runs in its own cloud browser on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore. Several run at once, follow a recipe for each merchant, and capture evidence as they go.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq6",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "What is a specialist agent?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Forecasting & insights",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Some claims, like airline compensation, need expertise. Overpaid hires a specialist agent from the Masumi registry and pays its fee into escrow on Cardano.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq7",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "When does a specialist get paid?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Forecasting & insights",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>The fee is locked in escrow. The specialist submits proof of the result, and the fee releases after the unlock time unless Overpaid raises a dispute first.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq8",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "What is a bloc?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Forecasting & insights",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>People who pay for the same thing pledge together on Cardano. Providers see the pledged demand and bid for everyone at once, and each member is refunded the difference.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq9",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "What do I need to get started?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Setup & integrations",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>An email export of your receipts and a card or bank statement. Overpaid processes them for you only.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq10",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Do I need a crypto wallet?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Setup & integrations",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Only for specialist fees and bloc pledges, which settle on Cardano. Finding money and fixing it on merchant sites works without one.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq11",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Which merchants are supported?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Setup & integrations",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Overpaid works on merchants' own websites through a recipe for each one. Hard cases go to specialist agents.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq12",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Do I sign in to merchants myself?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Setup & integrations",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Yes. You sign in through a live view of the browser, and the agent continues from there. Overpaid never stores your passwords.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq13",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Is my data safe?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Security, privacy & pricing",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Receipts are processed only for you, redacted before any model sees them, and deleted on request. Overpaid never sells your data.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq14",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Can a web page trick Overpaid into paying?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Security, privacy & pricing",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>No. The browsing agent has no wallet and no payment tools. Payments only happen in a separate service, for structured offers from Overpaid itself, within your limits.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq15",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "Does Overpaid do anything without asking?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Security, privacy & pricing",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>It finds and prepares on its own. Cancellations, disputes, deposits and payments always wait for your approval.</p>"
   },
   {
    "__id": "faq16",
    "gwbLlU2PH": "How much does Overpaid cost?",
    "cje2vNEgF": "Security, privacy & pricing",
    "YR6I3p2g6": "<p>Finding money is free. Overpaid takes a success fee only on money that actually comes back to you.</p>"
   }
  ],
